/*@meta

Author:
'Sound Dust'

Description:
'This might hurt your ears\r\nHold for the aftermath'

Usage:
'MW adds bile\r\nAT bend'

Categories:
'Pads:Distorted, FX:Glitch & Weird, FX:Hits & Impacts, FX:Nature & Ambient, FX:Noise & Rumble, FX:Sweeps & Risers'

